hadiths[56]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1399","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Salma ki beti Abi Salma ki beti Zainab se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main to bashar hun aur tum mere paas jhagda lekar aate ho, to shayad tum mein se baaz apni hujjat mein baaz se zyada tez ho aur main us ke liye is par faisla karun jo main is se sunta hun, to jis ke liye maine us ke bhai ke haq mein se kisi cheez ka faisla kya ho wo is mein se kuchh na le, main to use aag ka tukda kaat kar deta hun."
"1400","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ke paas musalman aur Yahudi jhagda lekar aae to Umar ne samjha ke haq Yahudi ke liye hai to us ke liye faisla kya to Yahudi ne us se kaha ke Allah ki qasam tum ne haq se faisla kya. To Umar bin Khattab ne use durre se mara phir kaha ke tumhein kya maloom. To Yahudi ne us se kaha ke hum pate hain ke koi qazi haq se faisla nahi karta magar us ke daein farishta hota hai aur us ke baein farishta hota hai jo use seedha rakhte hain aur use haq ki taufeeq dete hain jab tak wo haq ke sath ho, phir jab wo haq chhor de to wo dono chadh jaein aur use chhor dein."
"1401","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Usman ke bete Amr ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Ansari Abu Amra se, unhon ne Juhani Zaid bin Khalid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya main tumhein behtar gawahon ki khabar na dun, wo jo apni gawahi lekar aata hai is se pehle ke use manga jae ya apni gawahi ki khabar deta hai is se pehle ke use manga jae."
"1402","Mujhe Malik ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Iraq walon mein se aik mard Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya aur kaha ke main tumhare paas aise muamle ke liye aaya hun jis ka na sar hai aur na dum. To Umar ne kaha ke wo kya hai. Unhon ne kaha ke jhooti gawahiyan hamari sarzameen mein zahir ho gain. To Umar ne kaha ke kya aisa ho chuka hai. Unhon ne kaha ke haan. To Umar ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam Islam mein koi mard adil logon ke baghair khushhaal na hoga."
"1403","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke dushman aur badguman ki gawahi jaiz nahi."
"1404","Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Yasar ke bete Sulaiman aur is ke ilawa se khabar pahunchi ke un se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jise hadd lagai gayi ho ke kya us ki gawahi jaiz hai. To unhon ne kaha ke haan jab us se tauba zahir ho."
"1405","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ko is ke bare mein puchte suna to unhon ne is jaisa kaha jo Yasar ke bete Sulaiman ne kaha tha. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai, aur is ki wajah Allah Tabarak wa Taala ka qaul hai ke jo pakdaman auraton par tohmat lagate hain phir chaar gawah na laein to inhein assi kode maro aur un ki gawahi kabhi qubool na karo aur yehi nafarman hain, magar jo is ke baad tauba karein aur islah karein to Allah bakhshne wala rehem karne wala hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek wo hukm jis mein koi ikhtilaf nahi ke jise hadd lagai gayi phir us ne tauba ki aur islah ki us ki gawahi jaiz hai, aur is bare mein jo maine suna yehi mujhe sab se pasand hai."
"1406","Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gawah ke sath qasam se faisla kya."
"1407","Aur Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne Khattab ke bete Zaid ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdul Hameed ko likha jabke wo Kufa par aamil they ke gawah ke sath qasam se faisla karo."
"1408","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se pucha gaya ke kya gawah ke sath qasam se faisla kya jaega. To un dono ne kaha ke haan. Malik ne kaha ke aik gawah ke sath qasam se faisla karne mein sunnat guzar chuki hai, haq wala apne gawah ke sath qasam khata hai aur apna haq pata hai, phir agar wo inkar kare aur qasam khane se inkar kare to jis se manga gaya hai use qasam khilayi jae gi, phir agar wo qasam khae to wo haq us se saqit ho jaega, aur agar wo qasam khane se inkar kare to haq us ke malik ke liye us par sabit hoga. Malik ne kaha ke ye to maal mein khas hai aur hudood mein se kisi mein wajeh nahi hota, aur na nikah mein aur na talaaq mein aur na azadi mein aur na chori mein aur na tohmat mein, phir agar kehne wala kahe ke azadi to maal mein se hai. To us ne ghalti ki, ye waisa nahi jaisa us ne kaha, aur agar ye waisa hota jaisa us ne kaha to ghulam apne gawah ke sath qasam khata jab wo gawah lekar aae ke us ke aaqa ne use azad kya hai, jabke ghulam jab maal mein se maal par gawah lekar aae jis ka dawa kare wo apne gawah ke sath qasam khata hai aur apna haq pata hai jaisa azaad qasam khata hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek sunnat hai ke ghulam jab apni azadi par gawah lekar aae to us ke aaqa se qasam khilayi jae ke us ne use azad na kya hai aur ye us se batil ho jaega. Malik ne kaha ke isi tarah hamare nazdeek talaaq mein bhi sunnat hai, jab aurat gawah lekar aae ke us ke shohar ne use talaaq di hai to us ke shohar se qasam khilayi jae ke us ne use talaaq na di, phir jab wo qasam khae to us par talaaq wajeh na hogi. Malik ne kaha ke talaaq aur azadi ki sunnat aik gawah mein aik hai, qasam to aurat ke shohar par aur ghulam ke aaqa par hogi, aur azadi to hudood mein se hadd hai jis mein auraton ki gawahi jaiz nahi kyunke jab ghulam azad ho jae to us ki hurmat sabit ho jati hai aur us ke liye hudood wajeh hoti hain aur us par wajeh hoti hain, aur agar wo zina kare jabke wo muhsin ho to rajm kya jaega, aur agar ghulam qatal kare to is se qatal kya jaega, aur us ke liye wirasat sabit hogi us ke aur jo is se wirasat pae un ke darmiyan, phir agar hujjat karne wala hujjat kare aur kahe ke agar mard apne ghulam ko azad kare aur mard aae jo ghulam ke aaqa se apne qarz ka talab kare aur us ke us haq par mard aur do auratein gawahi dein to ye haq ghulam ke aaqa par sabit hoga yahan tak ke is se us ki azadi radd ki jae gi jab ghulam ke aaqa ka ghulam ke ilawa maal na ho, wo is se azadi mein auraton ki gawahi jaiz karna chahta hai, to ye waisa nahi jaisa us ne kaha, balke is ki misaal hai ke mard apne ghulam ko azad kare phir us ke aaqa par haq ke talab karne wala aik gawah lekar aae aur apne gawah ke sath qasam khae phir apna haq pae aur is se ghulam ki azadi radd ho, ya mard aae jis ke aur ghulam ke aaqa ke darmiyan mel jol ho aur wo kahe ke ghulam ke aaqa par us ka maal hai to ghulam ke aaqa se kaha jaega ke qasam khao ke tum par jo dawa kya gaya wo nahi, phir agar wo inkar kare aur qasam khane se inkar kare to haq wala qasam khae ga aur us ka haq ghulam ke aaqa par sabit hoga aur ye ghulam ki azadi ko radd karega jab maal us ke aaqa par sabit ho. Unhon ne kaha ke isi tarah mard londi se nikah kare aur wo us ki biwi ho aur londi ka aaqa us mard ke paas aae jis ne is se nikah kya hai aur kahe ke tum ne mujh se meri fulan londi ko tum ne aur fulan ne itne itne dinar se khareeda, to londi ka shohar is ka inkar kare aur londi ka aaqa mard aur do auraton se aae aur wo jo us ne kaha us par gawahi dein to us ki bai sabit hogi aur us ka haq haq hoga aur londi apne shohar par haram ho jaegi aur ye in dono ke darmiyan judai hogi jabke auraton ki gawahi talaaq mein jaiz nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is mein se ye bhi hai ke mard azaad mard par tohmat lagae aur us par hadd wajeh ho aur mard aur do auratein aaein aur gawahi dein ke jis par tohmat lagai gayi wo mamluk ghulam hai to ye hadd tohmat lagane wale se utha lega is ke baad ke us par wajeh ho chuki ho jabke auraton ki gawahi tohmat mein jaiz nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is jaisa hai jis mein faisla aur guzri hui sunnat juda hoti hai ke do auratein bache ke rone par gawahi detin hain to is se us ki wirasat wajib hoti hai yahan tak ke waris hota hai aur us ka maal us ke liye hoga jo is ka waris ho agar bacha mar jae jabke un do auraton ke sath jinhon ne gawahi di mard aur na qasam ho, aur ye sone aur chandi aur zameenon aur deewaron aur ghulamon aur in ke siwa maal mein se azeem maal mein ho sakta hai, aur agar do auratein aik dirham ya is se kam ya zyada par gawahi dein to un ki gawahi koi cheez qata na karegi aur jaiz na hogi magar ke in dono ke sath gawah ya qasam ho. Malik ne kaha ke logon mein se jo kehta hai ke aik gawah ke sath qasam na hogi. Aur Allah Tabarak wa Taala ke qaul se hujjat karta hai aur us ka qaul haq hai ke apne mardon mein se do gawah banao, phir agar do mard na hon to mard aur do auratein jinhein tum gawahon mein pasand karo, wo kehta hai ke phir agar wo mard aur do auratein na lae to us ke liye kuchh nahi aur wo apne gawah ke sath qasam na khae. Malik ne kaha ke jo ye qaul kehta hai us par hujjat ye hai ke us se kaha jae ke batao agar mard mard par maal ka dawa kare to kya jis se manga gaya hai wo qasam na khaega ke wo haq us par nahi, phir agar wo qasam khae to ye us se batil ho jaega, aur agar qasam se inkar kare to haq wala qasam khaega ke us ka haq haq hai. Aur us ka haq us ke sathi par sabit hoga, to ye wo hai jis mein logon mein se kisi ke nazdeek aur mulkon mein se kisi mulk mein koi ikhtilaf nahi, to ye kis se liya gaya ya Allah ki kitab mein kis jagah paya gaya, phir agar wo is ka iqrar kare to gawah ke sath qasam ka iqrar kare agarche ye Allah Azza wa Jal ki kitab mein na ho, aur use is se kafi hai jo sunnat mein guzar chuki lekin aadmi chahta hai ke durust chehra aur hujjat ki jagah jane, to is mein us ki wazahat hai jo is mein se mushkil hua insha Allah Taala."
"1409","Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne muezzin Abdur Rahman ke bete Jamil se riwayat kya ke wo Umar bin Abdul Aziz ke paas hazir hote they jabke wo logon ke darmiyan faisla karte they, phir jab us ke paas mard aata jo mard par haq ka dawa karta to dekhte, phir agar in dono ke darmiyan mel jol ho to jis par dawa kya gaya use qasam khilate, aur agar is mein se kuchh na hota to use qasam na khilate. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm is par hai ke jo mard par dawe se dawa kare to dekha jaega, phir agar in dono ke darmiyan mel jol ho to jis par dawa kya gaya use qasam khilayi jae gi, phir agar wo qasam khae to wo haq us se batil ho jaega, aur agar wo qasam khane se inkar kare aur qasam dawa karne wale par lautae aur haq ka talab karne wala qasam khae to apna haq le."
"1410","Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke Zubair ke bete Abdullah apne darmiyan zakhmon mein bachon ki gawahi se faisla karte they. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke bachon ki gawahi apne darmiyan zakhmon mein jaiz hai aur un ke ilawa par jaiz nahi, balke un ki gawahi apne darmiyan zakhmon mein akeli jaiz hai, is ke ilawa mein jaiz nahi jab ye is se pehle ho ke wo juda hon ya bigad jaein ya seekh lein, phir agar wo juda ho jaein to un ki gawahi nahi magar ke wo juda hone se pehle adilon ko apni gawahi par gawah bana chuke hon."
"1411","Yahya ne kaha ke mujhe Malik ne, Waqqas ke bete Abi Waqqas ke bete Utba ke bete Hashim ke bete Hashim se, Nastas ke bete Abdullah se, Ansari Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo mere mimbar par jhooti qasam khae wo apna thikana aag mein banae."
"1412","Mujhe Malik ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Ala se, Salmi Kaab ke bete Maabad se, unhon ne apne bhai Ansari Malik ke bete Kaab ke bete Abdullah se, Umama ke bete Abu Umama se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo musalman mard ka haq apni qasam se kaate Allah us par Jannat haram karega aur us ke liye aag wajib karega. Unhon ne kaha ke agarche mamuli cheez ho ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke agarche arak ka daali ho, agarche arak ka daali ho, agarche arak ka daali ho. Aap ne teen martaba kaha."
"1413","Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne Husain ke bete Dawood se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Murri Tarif ke bete Abu Ghatfan ko kehte suna ke Ansari Sabit ke bete Zaid aur Muti ke bete Ibn Muti ne aik ghar mein jhagda kiya jo in dono ke darmiyan tha aur Hakam ke bete Marwan ke paas jo Madina par ameer they, to Hakam ke bete Marwan ne Sabit ke bete Zaid par mimbar par qasam ka faisla kya. To Sabit ke bete Zaid ne kaha ke main us ke liye apni jagah qasam khaunga. Unhon ne kaha ke Marwan ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam huqooq ke faisle ki jagah ke siwa nahi. To Sabit ke bete Zaid ne qasam khana shuru kya ke us ka haq haq hai. Aur mimbar par qasam khane se inkar karte rahe. Unhon ne kaha ke Hakam ke bete Marwan is se taajjub karne lage. Malik ne kaha ke meri rai nahi ke koi mimbar par chauthai dinar se kam par qasam khae aur ye teen dirham hain."
"1414","Yahya ne kaha ke mujhe Malik ne, Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke girwi band na hoga."
"1415","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Marwan ke bete Abdul Malik ne us aurat ke bare mein faisla kya jo zabardasti se pahunchi gayi ke us ka meher us par hai jo is se aisa kare. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek us mard ke bare mein hukm hai jo aurat se zabardasti kare, chahe kunwari ho ya saeeba, ke agar wo azaad ho to us par us jaisi ka meher hai aur agar wo londi ho to us par jo us ki qeemat mein kami hui, aur is mein saza zabardasti karne wale par hai aur zabardasti ki gayi par is tamam mein koi saza nahi, aur agar zabardasti karne wala ghulam ho to ye us ke aaqa par hai magar ke wo chahe ke use supurd kare."
"1416","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo apna deen badle use qatal karo. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qaul ka mana hamare khayal mein, wallahu alam, ke jo apna deen badle use qatal karo. Ye hai ke jo Islam se ghair ki taraf nikle jaise zindeeq aur is jaisa, to jab ye zahir hon to qatal kiye jaein aur in se tauba na mangi jae kyunke un ki tauba maloom nahi, aur wo kufr chhupate they aur Islam zahir karte they, to meri rai nahi ke in se tauba mangi jae aur na un ka qaul qubool kya jae, aur jo Islam se ghair ki taraf nikle aur use zahir kare to us se tauba mangi jae gi, phir agar tauba kare warna qatal kya jaega, aur ye is tarah ke agar qoum is par hoti to meri rai hoti ke inhein Islam ki dawat di jae aur in se tauba mangi jae, phir agar tauba karein to un se qubool kya jaega aur agar tauba na karein to qatal kiye jaein, aur is se us ka irada na kya gaya hamare khayal mein, wallahu alam, jo Yahudiya se Nasraniya ki taraf nikle aur na jo Nasraniya se Yahudiya ki taraf, aur na jo tamam deen walon mein se apna deen badle magar Islam, to jo Islam se ghair ki taraf nikle aur use zahir kare to yehi hai jis ka irada kya gaya, wallahu alam."
"1417","Mujhe Malik ne Qari ke bete Abd ke bete Abdullah ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Ashari ke bete Abi Musa ki taraf se Umar bin Khattab ke paas mard aaya to unhon ne us se logon ke bare mein pucha to us ne unhein khabar di, phir Umar ne us se kaha ke kya tum mein koi hairan karne wali khabar thi. To us ne kaha ke haan, mard ne apne Islam ke baad kufr kya. Unhon ne kaha ke tum ne us ke sath kya kya. Unhon ne kaha ke hum ne use qareeb kya aur us ki gardan mari. To Umar ne kaha ke kya tum ne use teen din qaid na kya aur use har din roti na khilayi aur is se tauba na mangi, shayad wo tauba kare aur Allah ke hukm ki taraf laute, phir Umar ne kaha ke aye Allah main hazir na tha aur na maine hukm diya aur na main razi hua jab mujhe khabar pahunchi."
"1418","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Samman ke bete Abi Saleh ke bete Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Ubada ke bete Saad ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke batao agar main apni biwi ke sath mard paun to kya use mohlat dun yahan tak ke chaar gawah lekar aaun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan."
"1419","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Sham walon mein se aik mard jise Khaibari ka beta kaha jata hai ne apni biwi ke sath mard paya to use qatal kar diya ya in dono ko qatal kar diya, to Sufyan ke bete Muawiya par is mein faisla mushkil hua to unhon ne Ashari ke bete Abu Musa ko likha ke us ke liye Talib ke bete Ali bin Abi Talib se puche, to Abu Musa ne is ke bare mein Talib ke bete Ali bin Abi Talib se pucha to Talib ke bete Ali ne us se kaha ke ye cheez meri sarzameen mein nahi, main tumhein qasam deta hun ke mujhe khabar do. To Abu Musa ne us se kaha ke Sufyan ke bete Muawiya ne mujhe likha hai ke main is ke bare mein tum se puchhun. To Talib ke bete Ali ne kaha ke main Abu Hasan hun, agar wo chaar gawah na lae to apni gardan de."
"1420","Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, Jamila ke bete Abi Jamila Suneen se jo Saleem ke Banu mein se mard hain riwayat kya ke us ne Umar bin Khattab ke zamane mein lawarees bacha paya. Unhon ne kaha ke main use lekar Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya to unhon ne kaha ke tumhein is jaan ko lene par kis ne ubhara. To us ne kaha ke maine use zae paya aur use le liya. To us ke arif ne us se kaha ke aye Ameerul Momineen ye saleh mard hai. To Umar ne us se kaha ke kya aisa hai. Unhon ne kaha ke haan. To Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jao ye azaad hai aur tumhare liye us ki wala hai aur hum par us ka nafaqa hai."
"1421","Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Waqqas ke bete Abi Waqqas ke bete Utba ne apne bhai Waqqas ke bete Abi Waqqas ke bete Saad se ahad kya tha ke Zama ki waleeda ka beta mujh se hai to use apne paas le lo. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab Fatah ka saal tha to Saad ne use liya aur kaha ke mere bhatija hai, mujh se is mein ahad kya gaya tha. To Zama ke bete Abd us ke paas khada hua aur kaha ke mera bhai hai aur mere walid ki waleeda ka beta hai jo us ke bistar par paida hua. To wo dono Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jhagda lekar gae to Saad ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah mere bhatija hai, mujh se is mein ahad kya gaya tha. Aur Zama ke bete Abd ne kaha ke mera bhai hai aur mere walid ki waleeda ka beta hai jo us ke bistar par paida hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo tumhare liye hai aye Zama ke bete Abd. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bacha bistar ke liye hai aur badkar ke liye pathar hai. Phir Zama ki beti Sauda se farmaya ke is se parda karo. Jo us ne Waqqas ke bete Abi Waqqas ke bete Utba se mushabihat dekhi thi. Unhon ne kaha ke us ne use na dekha yahan tak ke Allah Azza wa Jal se mila."
"1422","Mujhe Malik ne Hadi ke bete Abdullah ke bete Yazeed se, unhon ne Haris Taimi ke bete Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se, unhon ne Umayya ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke aik aurat jis ka shohar halaak ho gaya tha us ne chaar mahine aur das din iddat guzari phir nikah kya jab halal hui aur apne shohar ke paas chaar mahine aur nisf mahina thehri phir mukammal bacha jana, to us ka shohar Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya aur un se is ka zikr kya to Umar ne Jahiliya ki budhi auraton mein se auraton ko bulaya aur un se is ke bare mein pucha to un mein se aik aurat ne kaha ke main tumhein is aurat ke bare mein khabar deti hun, us ka shohar halaak hua jab wo is se haamila thi aur us par khoon bahe to us ka bacha us ke pet mein jam gaya, phir jab us ka shohar jis ne is se nikah kya tha use pahuncha aur bache ko pani pahuncha to bacha us ke pet mein harkat karne laga aur bada ho gaya. To Umar bin Khattab ne us ki tasdeeq ki aur in dono ke darmiyan judai karai aur kaha ke Umar ne kaha ke tum dono se mujhe bhalai ke siwa khabar na pahunchi aur bache ko pehle se milaya."
"1423","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab Jahiliya ke bachon ko Islam mein jis ne unhein dawa kya tha us se milate they, to do mard aae jabke dono aurat ke bache ka dawa karte they to Umar bin Khattab ne qayif ko bulaya aur un dono ko dekha to qayif ne kaha ke wo dono is mein shareek hue hain, to Umar bin Khattab ne use durre se mara phir aurat ko bulaya aur kaha ke mujhe apni khabar do. To us ne kaha ke ye, dono mardon mein se aik ke liye, mere paas aata tha. Jabke wo apne ghar walon ke oonton mein thi aur use na chhorta tha yahan tak ke wo aur wo samajhte ke us se hamal thehar gaya hai, phir wo is se munsarif hua aur us par khoon bahe, phir is ke baad is par ye, dusre ke liye, khalifa hua to main nahi janti ke ye in dono mein se kis se hai. Unhon ne kaha ke qayif ne takbeer kahi to Umar ne ladke se kaha ke in dono mein se jis se chaho dosti rakho."
"1424","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ya Affan ke bete Usman mein se aik ne us aurat ke bare mein faisla kya jo mard ko apne nafs se dhoka de aur zikr kare ke wo azaad hai to us ne is se nikah kya aur wo us ke liye bache jani to faisla kya ke apne bache ko un jaisa se fidya de. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke qeemat is mein zyada adl hai insha Allah."
"1425","Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Umar ke bete Abdullah ke bete Salim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke logon ka kya haal hai ke apni waleedon se sohbat karte hain phir inhein alag karte hain, mere paas koi waleeda na aae jis ka aaqa iqrar kare ke wo is se mil chuka hai magar maine us ke bache ko us se milaya, to is ke baad azal karo ya chhoro."
"1426","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ubaid ki beti Safiya bint Abi Ubaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke logon ka kya haal hai ke apni waleedon ko khushbu lagate hain phir inhein chhorte hain ke nikalti hain, mere paas koi waleeda na aae jis ka aaqa iqrar kare ke wo is se mil chuka hai magar maine us ke bache ko us se milaya, to inhein is ke baad bhejo ya roko. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek Umm Walad ke bare mein hukm hai jab wo jinayat kare ke us ka aaqa us ke aur us ki qeemat ke darmiyan zamin hoga aur us ke liye nahi ke use supurd kare aur us par us ki jinayat mein se us ki qeemat se zyada uthana nahi."
"1427","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo murda zameen ko zinda kare wo us ke liye hai aur zalim rag ke liye haq nahi."
"1428","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Salim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo murda zameen ko zinda kare wo us ke liye hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm is par hai."
"1429","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mahzoor aur Muzainab ke naale mein farmaya ke takhnon tak roko phir upar wale ko neeche wale par bhejo."
"1430","Mujhe Malik ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke pani ka fazil na roko taake is se ghaas roki jae."
"1431","Mujhe Malik ne Harisa ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad Abu Rijal se, unhon ne apni walida Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kuwen ke bache hue pani ko na roko."
"1432","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Mazini Yahya ke bete Amr se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke na nuqsan aur na badle mein nuqsan."
"1433","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi apne padosi ko lakdi se na roke jo wo us ki deewar mein gaade. Phir Abu Huraira kehte hain ke mujhe kya hai ke main tumhein is se munh phere dekhta hun, Allah ki qasam main use tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan phenkunga."
"1434","Mujhe Malik ne Mazini Yahya ke bete Amr se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Khalifa ke bete Dahhak ne Uraiz se apni khadi nikali aur Maslama ke bete Muhammad ki zameen mein se guzarna chaha to Muhammad ne inkar kya. To Dahhak ne us se kaha ke tum mujhe kyun rokte ho jabke ye tumhare liye faida hai jis se tum pehle aur aakhir mein piyoge aur tumhein nuqsan na dega. To Muhammad ne inkar kya to Dahhak ne is mein Umar bin Khattab se baat ki to Umar bin Khattab ne Maslama ke bete Muhammad ko bulaya aur use hukm diya ke use rasta chhore. To Muhammad ne kaha ke nahi. To Umar ne kaha ke tum apne bhai ko kyun rokte ho jo use faida de jabke ye tumhare liye faida hai jis se tum pehle aur aakhir mein sairab karoge jabke wo tumhein nuqsan na dega. To Muhammad ne kaha ke nahi Allah ki qasam. To Umar ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam wo is se zaroor guzrega agarche tumhare pet par. To Umar ne use hukm diya ke is se guzre aur Dahhak ne aisa kya."
"1435","Mujhe Malik ne Mazini Yahya ke bete Amr se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke un ke dada ki deewar mein Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ka rabi tha aur Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ne use deewar ke kinare ki taraf muntaqil karna chaha jo us ki zameen se zyada qareeb hai to deewar wale ne use roka to Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ne is mein Umar bin Khattab se baat ki to Umar bin Khattab ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke liye use muntaqil karne ka faisla kya."
"1436","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Daili Zaid ke bete Saur se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo ghar ya zameen Jahiliya mein taqseem ki gayi wo Jahiliya ki taqseem par hai, aur jo ghar ya zameen Islam ne pai aur taqseem na ki gayi wo Islam ki taqseem par hai. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko us ke bare mein kehte suna jo halaak ho aur Aliya aur Safila mein maal chhore ke bail charkhe wale ke sath taqseem na kya jae magar ke us ke ghar wale is se razi hon, aur bail chashme wale ke sath taqseem kya jaega jab wo is jaisa ho, aur maal jab aik sarzameen mein hon aur jo in dono ke darmiyan hai qareeb ho ke in mein se har maal ki qeemat lagai jae phir un ke darmiyan taqseem kya jae, aur rehne aur ghar is manzilay mein hain."
"1437","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Mahisa ke bete Saad ke bete Haram se riwayat kya ke Azib ke bete Bara ki oontni mard ki deewar mein dakhil hui aur is mein fasad kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya ke deewaron walon par din mein in ki hifazat hai aur jo maweshi raat mein fasad karein wo zamanat un ke ghar walon par hai."
"1438","Mujhe Malik ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hatib ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Yahya se riwayat kya ke Hatib ke ghulamon ne Muzaina ke aik mard ki oontni churai aur use zibah kiya to ye Umar bin Khattab tak uthaya gaya to Umar ne Salt ke bete Kaseer ko hukm diya ke un ke haath kaatein phir Umar ne kaha ke meri rai hai ke tum inhein bhooka rakhte ho. Phir Umar ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam main tumhein aisa tawaan dunga jo tum par giran guzrega, phir Muzni se kaha ke tumhari oontni ki qeemat kitni hai. To Muzni ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam main use chaar sau dirham se rokta tha. To Umar ne kaha ke use aath sau dirham do. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek amal is par nahi ke qeemat dogni ki jae lekin logon ka muamla hamare nazdeek is par guzar chuka hai ke mard oont ya sawari ki qeemat ada karta hai jis din use le."
"1439","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Humaid se aur Bashir ke bete Numan ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke un dono ne unhein Bashir ke bete Numan se bayan kya ke unhon ne kaha ke un ke walid Bashir unhein lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha ke maine apne is bete ko apna ghulam bakhsh diya jo mere liye tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum ne apne tamam beton ko is jaisa bakhsha hai. To unhon ne kaha ke nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use wapas lo."
"1440","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ne unhein Ghaba mein apne maal se bees wasq ka kata hua phal bakhsh diya tha, phir jab unhein wafat aayi to kaha ke Allah ki qasam aye beti logon mein se koi mere baad ghina mein tum se zyada pasand nahi aur na mere baad faqr mein tum se zyada azeez mujh par, aur maine tumhein bees wasq ka kata hua bakhsh diya tha, to agar tum ne use kaat liya hota aur qabze mein le liya hota to tumhare liye hota, jabke ye aaj waris ka maal hai, aur ye to tumhare do bhai aur do behnein hain to use Allah ki kitab par taqseem karo. Aaisha ne kaha ke maine kaha ke aye abba Allah ki qasam agar aisa aisa hota to main use chhor deti, ye to Asma hain to dusri kaun hai. To Abu Bakr ne kaha ke Kharija ki beti ke pet wala. Main use londi samajhta hun."
"1441","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Qari ke bete Abd ke bete Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke logon ka kya haal hai ke apne beton ko bakhshte hain phir inhein rokte hain, phir agar un mein se aik ka beta mar jae to kehta hai ke mera maal mere haath mein hai, maine use kisi ko na diya. Aur agar wo khud mar jae to kehta hai ke wo mere bete ke liye hai, maine use use de diya tha. Jo bakhshish bakhshe aur jise bakhshi gayi us ne qabza na kya ho yahan tak ke agar wo mare to us ke warison ke liye hogi, to wo batil hai."
"1442","Mujhe Malik ne Husain ke bete Dawood se, unhon ne Murri Tarif ke bete Abu Ghatfan se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo rishtedari ke liye ya sadqe ke taur par tohfa bakhshe wo is mein na laute, aur jo tohfa bakhshe aur samjhe ke us ne is se sawab ka irada kya hai to wo apne tohfe par hai, is mein laute ga jab is se razi na ho. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke tohfa jab sawab ke liye bakhshe gae ke paas badal jae zyadati ya kami se to bakhshe gae par hai ke us ke malik ko us ki qeemat de jis din use qabze mein liya."
"1443","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se, unhon ne Ansari Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo mard umra bakhshe apne liye aur apni aulad ke liye to wo us ke liye hai jise di gayi, us ko dene wale ki taraf kabhi na laute gi. Kyunke us ne atiya diya jis mein wirasatein wajeh huin."
"1444","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Qasim ke bete Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Makhul Dimishqi ko Muhammad ke bete Qasim se umra ke bare mein aur jo log is mein kehte hain puchte suna to Muhammad ke bete Qasim ne kaha ke maine logon ko na paya magar wo apne maal mein aur jo diye mein apni sharton par hain. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek hukm is par hai ke umra us ko dene wale ki taraf lautti hai jab wo na kahe ke wo tumhare liye aur tumhari aulad ke liye hai."
"1445","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Umar ke bete Abdullah bin Umar ne Umar ki beti Hafsa se us ka ghar wirasat mein paya. Unhon ne kaha ke Hafsa ne Khattab ke bete Zaid ki beti ko rehne diya tha jab tak wo jeein, phir jab Zaid ki beti mar gayin to Abdullah bin Umar ne rehne ki jagah qabze mein li aur samjha ke wo us ke liye hai."
"1446","Mujhe Malik ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se, unhon ne Munbaith ke azad karda Yazeed se, unhon ne Juhani Khalid ke bete Zaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mard Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se giri padi cheez ke bare mein pucha. To Aap ne farmaya ke us ka bartan aur bandhan pehchano phir us ka saal bhar elan karo, phir agar us ka malik aae warna is se jo chaho karo. Unhon ne kaha ke bakri ka kya hukm hai ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke wo tumhare liye ya tumhare bhai ke liye ya bhediye ke liye hai. Unhon ne kaha ke oont ka kya hukm hai. Aap ne farmaya ke tumhein is se kya, us ke sath us ki mashk aur us ka joota hai, wo pani par aata hai aur darakht khata hai yahan tak ke us ka malik use pa le."
"1447","Mujhe Malik ne Musa ke bete Ayyub se, unhon ne Badr Juhani ke bete Abdullah ke bete Muawiya se riwayat kya ke us ke walid ne unhein khabar di ke wo Sham ke raaste qoum ke thikane utra aur assi dinar ki thaili pai to is ka zikr Umar bin Khattab se kya to Umar ne us se kaha ke masjidon ke darwazon par us ka elan karo aur har us se zikr karo jo Sham se aae saal bhar, phir jab saal guzar jae to is se jo chaho karo."
"1448","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke aik mard ne giri padi cheez pai aur Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aaya aur un se kaha ke maine giri padi cheez pai hai to is mein tum kya kehte ho. To Abdullah bin Umar ne us se kaha ke us ka elan karo. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kar liya. Unhon ne kaha ke zyada karo. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kar liya. To Abdullah ne kaha ke main tumhein hukm nahi deta ke use khao, aur agar tum chahte to use na lete."
"1449","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Dahhak Ansari ke bete Sabit ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Harra mein oont paya aur use bandh liya phir is ka zikr Umar bin Khattab se kya to Umar ne use hukm diya ke teen martaba us ka elan kare. To Sabit ne us se kaha ke us ne mujhe meri kheti se mashghool kar diya hai. To Umar ne us se kaha ke use chhor do jahan use paya tha."
"1450","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha jabke wo apni peeth Kaaba se lagaye hue they ke jo gumi uthae wo gumrah hai."
"1451","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ko kehte suna ke Umar bin Khattab ke zamane mein oonton ki gumiyan doodh wali oontniyan thin jo bachon ko janam detin aur koi inhein na chhuta tha, yahan tak ke jab Affan ke bete Usman ka zamana tha to unhon ne un ka elan karane ka hukm diya phir wo bechi jatin, phir jab un ka malik aata to use us ki qeemat di jati."
"1452","Mujhe Malik ne Saad ke bete Saad ke bete Saeed ke bete Shurahbil ke bete Amr ke bete Saeed se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Ubada ke bete Saad Rasulullah ke sath nikle."
"1453","Mujhe Malik ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke aik mard ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke meri maan achanak mar gayi hai aur meri rai hai ke agar wo bolti to sadqa karti, to kya main us ki taraf se sadqa karun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan."
"1454","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Khazraj ke Haris ke Banu mein se Ansar mein se aik mard ne apne maan baap par sadqa kya to wo dono halaak ho gae aur un ke bete ne wo maal wirasat mein paya jabke wo khajoor tha, to is ke bare mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se pucha to Aap ne farmaya ke tum apne sadqe mein ajr pa chuke aur use apni wirasat se lo."
